From: Zain Al-Saffi <zain.alsaffi@eucalyptus.vc>
Date: Sun, 17 May 2026 18:43:26 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign portfolio: warm-dark editorial theme, refresh
 credentials
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Full visual refactor moving away from the cyberpunk/HUD aesthetic that
read as AI-portfolio template. New direction is Linear-inspired warm
dark mode with editorial typography (Instrument Serif + Inter + JetBrains
Mono), a single muted amber accent, and generous spacing.

Theme + typography
- New ink-* palette in tailwind.config (warm near-black bg, off-white text)
- Kept carbon-* aliases pointing at the new palette so admin pages keep
  working without churn
- Instrument Serif for display/italics, Inter for body, JetBrains Mono
  for eyebrows/dates; subtle grain overlay on body

Pages
- Hero: editorial intro (name in mixed serif/sans, one tight tagline,
  "currently" facts row). Dropped the typing animation, "SYSTEM ONLINE"
  framing, neon aura, and "scroll for logs"
- About: removed the Terminal Gate barrier entirely. Replaced the four
  "WHO_AM_I?" sections with a short prose paragraph + a quiet
  "Currently" list. Personality lightly woven in
- Experience: rebuilt as an editorial list (date column / content
  column, hairline dividers) instead of a glowing timeline with dots.
  Updated with all latest credentials from the new resume — Optiver
  incoming, Eucalyptus AI Growth, UQ Research Assistant (Meta Content
  Library NLP), COMP3710 tutoring, SVPartners, Thiess, UQ Racing,
  UQCS President 2026
- Projects: clean tabular layout. IMC Prosperity 3 (9th AU / 60th
  global), BlackBoxLabs (98.98% acc, 1000+ DL), ValoStats, AlgoJam,
  SkinDetect with updated numbers
- Contact: replaced the single LinkedIn card with a row-list of email
  + LinkedIn + GitHub
- Navbar: simplified to four anchor links + a single CTA

Booking modal
- All API contracts (/api/availability, /api/request-meeting), week-grid
  logic, timezone handling, VIP token, auto-refresh, and three-step flow
  preserved verbatim
- Restyled to match the new warm-dark theme

Cleanup
- TerminalGate.jsx neutralised to a no-op stub
- index.html title + meta refreshed
- App.css emptied; all global styles live in index.css

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
